{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/10/23/3794333/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ九州シリーズ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「アンダー」という曲に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆んな真正面からぶつかって闘って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リハから本番までハードでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参戦してくださった皆さんの感想も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかった！だけではないと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡3日目、鹿児島では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2曲しかステージに立てず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんを観に来て下さった方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ありませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のアンダーライブも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の中で色々と葛藤があって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最終的にステージに立てたのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでもひめたんの体調を考慮して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"調整を重ねて下さったスタッフの皆様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広い心で待っていてくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのみんな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして期待して下さった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆様のお陰です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後の最後まで迷惑を掛けてしまいましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全員揃ってステージに立てた事、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せに思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたが何を考えてるか知りたいから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたの言葉で聞かせて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなことをよく言われます、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突き放してる訳ではなくてね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただどうしたら良いかわからなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"殻にこもってしまうだけなんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆んなが理解しようとしてくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も思ってることを素直に打ち明けて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部受け止めてくれて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかったよって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えが聞けて良かったよって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言ってくれる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな素敵な経験を初めてしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一度、出演を諦めかけましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参加して良かったなって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"思ったツアーでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/10/23/3794333/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一日の締めのMCはいつも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手がガクガク震えてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配で押さえていようかと思ったと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世に言われました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一週間も一緒にいると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーとの思い出が沢山出来て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸がいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、いつもの癖で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋の電気付けたまま家を出たらしく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰って撃沈しました。あーあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2017/10/23/3794333/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャーさんお手製 旅のしおり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}